{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule5SceneV","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Scene.swift#L664","fileName":"Scene.swift"},"title":"Scene","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy, and the components and resources of the types","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a registry names.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/scene"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a scene to save and load whole worlds, such as a game’s save file or a level made in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editor, or to store a group of entities you spawn many times, such as an enemy squad. Take a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scene with "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/scene(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", passing a "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of the types to save. Then either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rebuild the whole world with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"World(restoring:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or add the scene’s entities to another"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world as new ones with "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(contentsOf:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Encoding needs nothing more; decoding needs the registry in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"decoder’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"userInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" under ","type":"text"},{"code":"CodingUserInfoKey.typeRegistry","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Name.self, named: \"Name\")","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Turret\"))","try world.addChild(turret, to: ship)","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.scene(registry))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.typeRegistry] = registry","let scene = try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data)","print(scene.count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","","let restored = World(restoring: scene)","print(restored.parent(of: turret) == ship)","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Restoring keeps every entity handle, live or stale, meaning the same as in the original"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world, and the restored world hands out the same handles from later spawns. Types the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registry names but the data doesn’t are left out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene holds no hooks, observers, caches, indexes or change ticks, and the restored world’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components are all added at its first tick.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoding throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when the decoder’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"userInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"registry, when the data names a type the registry doesn’t, or for data that no world could","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"have produced.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/componentNames","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/count","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/resourceNames"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene\/encode(to:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryLookupError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapE